---
// The pupil and the adults of docs/produit.md, "Pour qui", told by the evening rather than by the child's faults; that
// organisation can be learned, docs/methode.md, "À retenir". An editorial pause on the brand's light plane: one large
// sentence, its second line in the brand's water, and the last words alone, under the highlighter of the top of the page.
// Nothing moves here.
---

<section class="bg-tint py-14 md:py-20 lg:py-28">
  <div class="container max-w-6xl">
    <h2 class="max-w-5xl text-2xl leading-snug text-pretty text-foreground sm:text-3xl lg:text-5xl lg:leading-tight">
      Le soir, savoir par où commencer n&apos;est pas simple. Un contrôle s&apos;oublie, un devoir reste à moitié fait, et la soirée tourne à la
      dispute. <span class="text-primary">Ou personne n&apos;est là pour aider.</span>
    </h2>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 lg:mt-12 lg:flex-row lg:items-baseline lg:gap-8">
      <p class="text-lg text-foreground lg:text-2xl">Parfois, c&apos;est l&apos;organisation qui bloque, plus que les leçons.</p>
      <p class="font-heading text-2xl font-extrabold text-foreground lg:text-3xl">
        <span class="highlighter">Et l&apos;organisation, ça s&apos;apprend.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
